-- Kit fix (balance pass 2026-09j): new Balance Config fields shared.skills.hawk.{gustKb,gustStun,gustR,gustCd} (Hawk Gust:
-- when the Hawk defends a surrounded Kit, monsters around Kit are pushed back and stunned, at most once per gustCd; no
-- damage, never bosses) and shared.skills.hawk.stunBase (every dive stuns the non-boss monsters it strikes). Defaults
-- keep today's game (gustKb 0, stunBase 0) until the pass is published. Patches only the shared.skills.hawk subtree of
-- the live config_schema, carrying every existing key.
